 "about": "I1 real time, a client: power on, D4 bought from the ticket hall (szi1 i1_buy, no teleport), a walk with player physics (move: no forward key exists in the input channel) from the ticket hall through D4 along the north shop lane (y 4150, clear of the bench islands) to the west end and back; perf windows and client frames at arc_east_long and at the middle of the hall (1280 x 720).",
